This fork adds Chromebook and local-Ollama patches and rebrands the user-facing
product as Ruth (`ruth`). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by anomalyco
or the OpenCode project.

Internal package names such as `@opencode/core` and the `@opencode-ai/plugin`
SDK import path are kept so existing plugins (including Oh My OpenCode /
oh-my-openagent) continue to load. The official OpenCode provider id
(`opencode`, used for OpenCode Zen cloud models) and URLs such as models.dev /
models.opencode.ai are unchanged because they must still resolve.

`ruth auth login` is the supported way to sign in to cloud providers. This
repository does not ship third-party API keys.

Default local model
-------------------
The default Ollama models `ruth` and `ruth-pro` are built from
huihui_ai/qwen3-abliterated (Qwen3 1.7B and 4B). Qwen3 is licensed under
Apache License 2.0 by Alibaba (https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3). The
abliterated weights are a community modification of those Apache-2.0
checkpoints. Ruth only adds a system prompt (identity and coding-agent
rules) via an Ollama Modelfile; it does not relicense the weights.
